    affected: "Windows Server 2012, 2012 R2, 2016, 2019, 2022, 2022 23H2 and 2025 before the May 2026 updates"
    fixed: "2016 10.0.14393.9140; 2019 10.0.17763.8755; 2022 10.0.20348.5074; 2022 23H2 10.0.25398.2330; 2025 10.0.26100.32772; 2012 6.2.9200.26079; 2012 R2 6.3.9600.23181"
